WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.320
Our Global Gateway investment

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:10.040
is about giving countries a better choice,
to give them an alternative.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.400
It is investments that will be sustainable

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.560
not only for our partners’ finances,

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.440
but also for the environment
and, of course, for the local communities.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:26.480
That is our offer to the world.
EUR 300 billion of possible investment.

